855
00:59:07,280 --> 00:59:16,960
[SPEAKER_00] Možete to pronaći na web-mjestu SwiftSonica, SwiftSonic, to je swiftsonic.com.

856
00:59:18,079 --> 00:59:22,719
[SPEAKER_00] Dakle, imamo Betsy koja otvara cijelu konferenciju.

857
00:59:23,039 --> 00:59:24,559
[SPEAKER_00] Volim Betsy, ona je tako draga.

858
01:00:00,000 --> 01:00:01,760
[SPEAKER_00] Kada sazna, dolazi na nacionalnu razinu.

859
01:00:02,000 --> 01:00:07,599
[SPEAKER_00] Da, pokušavam napraviti najave glavnih govornika u ponedjeljak, vjerojatno do 1.

860
01:00:07,920 --> 01:00:11,760
